<body>
<main class="guide">
<header class="guide-header">
<h1>Share a calendar event</h1>
<p class="summary">Invite a colleague to an existing Calendar event.</p>
</header>
<section class="intro">
<p>This guide shows how to invite someone to an event you <strong>already</strong> created.</p>
</section>
<section class="prerequisites">
<h2>Prerequisites</h2>
<ul>
<li>A Mac signed in to iCloud</li>
<li>An existing event</li>
</ul>
</section>
<h2 class="section">Open the event</h2>
<article class="step" id="step-1">
<h3 class="step-title"><span class="step-number" aria-label="Step 1">1</span><span class="step-text">Click <strong>Calendar</strong> in the Dock</span></h3>
<figure class="step-image">
<img src="data:image/png;base64,…" width="64" height="40" alt="Click Calendar in the Dock">
</figure>
</article>
<article class="step" id="step-2">
<h3 class="step-title"><span class="step-number" aria-label="Step 2">2</span><span class="step-text">Double-click the <em>Team sync</em> event</span></h3>
<figure class="step-image">
<img src="data:image/png;base64,…" width="64" height="40" alt="Double-click the Team sync event">
</figure>
<div class="step-description">
<p>The event opens in its own window.</p>
</div>
</article>
<aside class="note note-tip" role="note">
<p class="note-label">Tip</p>
<p>You can also select the event and press <code>⌘O</code> to open it.</p>
</aside>
<h2 class="section">Invite people</h2>
<article class="step" id="step-3">
<h3 class="step-title"><span class="step-number" aria-label="Step 3">3</span><span class="step-text">Type the guest&#39;s email in <strong>Add Invitees</strong></span></h3>
<figure class="step-image">
<img src="data:image/png;base64,…" width="32" height="20" alt="Type the guest&#x27;s email in Add Invitees">
</figure>
<div class="step-description">
<p>Separate several guests with commas.</p>
<ul>
<li>Guests get an email invite</li>
<li>You can remove them later</li>
</ul>
</div>
</article>
<article class="step" id="step-4">
<h3 class="step-title"><span class="step-number" aria-label="Step 4">4</span><span class="step-text">Right-click the guest and choose <strong>Send Email</strong></span></h3>
<figure class="step-image">
<img src="data:image/png;base64,…" width="64" height="40" alt="Right-click the guest and choose Send Email">
</figure>
</article>
<article class="step" id="step-5">
<h3 class="step-title"><span class="step-number" aria-label="Step 5">5</span><span class="step-text">Press <code>⌘S</code> to save</span></h3>
<figure class="step-image">
<img src="data:image/png;base64,…" width="32" height="20" alt="Press ⌘S to save">
</figure>
</article>
<aside class="note note-note" role="note">
<p class="note-label">Note</p>
<p>Guests see changes after they <a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/calendar/welcome/mac" rel="noopener noreferrer">refresh their calendar</a>.</p>
</aside>
</main>
</body>
</html>
